                                "sense_id": "c0f1bad9-68d6-3687-b9b8-d242c6c857d4",
                                "text": "Moreover, recent research showed that the amount of genetic material that can be moved horizontally may include small gene fragments, entire operons, superoperons that encode complex biochemical pathways, and whole chromosomes [ 54 ]."
